            {
                "entry_id": "030d74ed-0781-30f9-87b1-608212d5fcd3",
                "word": "manguier",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b463851b-9aaa-4bdf-b001-426a8d309118",
                        "entry_id": "030d74ed-0781-30f9-87b1-608212d5fcd3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "manguiers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5c8d4c0-f673-394c-9edc-5ccc9de92488",
                        "entry_id": "030d74ed-0781-30f9-87b1-608212d5fcd3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Grand arbre de la famille des Anacardiacées, à cime étalée, originaire d’Asie méridionale (Inde et Birmanie), que l’on cultive dans des régions tropicales et subtropicales pour ses fruits, les mangues, verdâtres, jaunes, rouges ou noirs, sont savoureux et d’une odeur agréable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a3ccfd7-66fa-4bae-84e9-69ec149dad23",
                                "sense_id": "b5c8d4c0-f673-394c-9edc-5ccc9de92488",
                                "text": "A 2 h. 1/2 au nord de Jana (Saint-Paul-Miki) se trouve le beau village de Kikinsi. C'est un site ravissant grâce aux faux-cotonniers, aux nombreux safoutiers, arbres superbes, aux palmiers et même aux manguiers qui ombragent le village."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93ac9316-bde5-482c-a365-d987c7593573",
                                "sense_id": "b5c8d4c0-f673-394c-9edc-5ccc9de92488",
                                "text": "Nous nous élevons rapidement et ne tardons pas à quitter la zone des cultures tropicales et subtropicales des terres basses. […] ; aux dattiers, aux dragonniers, aux manguiers, aux anoniers, aux avocatiers, aux goyaviers succèdent les arbres fruitiers des régions méditerranéennes, puis de l'Europe centrale. Nous montons toujours."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5e24dae-f6c4-4c74-b417-5328c94dcad5",
                                "sense_id": "b5c8d4c0-f673-394c-9edc-5ccc9de92488",
                                "text": "Plus de cocotiers ou de filaos, mais, çà et là, un arbre à pain, un manguier, un arbre à puni."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6680e229-2905-45af-ad32-ed348b71d1a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "030d74ed-0781-30f9-87b1-608212d5fcd3",
                        "source_sense_id": "b5c8d4c0-f673-394c-9edc-5ccc9de92488",
                        "target_lang_word": "mango",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "468aa230-4bfa-498f-aae9-b92916cf5483",
                        "source_entry_id": "030d74ed-0781-30f9-87b1-608212d5fcd3",
                        "source_sense_id": "b5c8d4c0-f673-394c-9edc-5ccc9de92488",
                        "target_lang_word": "mango",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mango",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87bb2d67-1d3d-3282-b91e-a1a8f9ec459b",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tropical Asian fruit tree, Mangifera indica."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f67898a-3209-4ce2-8cd1-6296367f2f4d",
                                                "sense_id": "87bb2d67-1d3d-3282-b91e-a1a8f9ec459b",
                                                "text": "On the hot days, he would lie in the shade of a mango and let little Eugenia clamber over his belly and tug at his beard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6549dd89-ae5c-3ce4-bb9b-146e6588b2bf",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fruit of the mango tree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56870735-ee36-4b93-a5b7-c4e40dc55496",
                                                "sense_id": "6549dd89-ae5c-3ce4-bb9b-146e6588b2bf",
                                                "text": "And I have one [bezoar] form'd round the Stone of that great Plum, which comes pickled from thence, and is called Mango."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5c0c7c4-a279-3090-add9-472758508d4f",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pickled vegetable or fruit with a spicy stuffing; a vegetable or fruit which has been mangoed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d9b08f2-a5b2-4ec2-b2fa-b9735abce4f8",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c0c7c4-a279-3090-add9-472758508d4f",
                                                "text": "In Pennsylvania and western Maryland, mangoes were generally made with green bell peppers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b7d1f0b-795b-3fdf-b406-3179a7876991",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A green bell pepper suitable for pickling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fefcc47-98a1-4607-893c-b4907ec0b6fd",
                                                "sense_id": "6b7d1f0b-795b-3fdf-b406-3179a7876991",
                                                "text": "Mango peppers by the dozen, if owned by the careful housewife, would gladden the appetite or disposition of any epicure or scold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c7e114e-c1db-4bd5-ae56-63d2b177f7d1",
                                                "sense_id": "6b7d1f0b-795b-3fdf-b406-3179a7876991",
                                                "text": "Best mango peppers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c24ce38-f8ec-4ad7-b0f7-5b4d9b8c3472",
                                                "sense_id": "6b7d1f0b-795b-3fdf-b406-3179a7876991",
                                                "text": "Cut tops from mangoes; remove seeds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f49b6a9-8bdd-4c48-aaf8-1942dcf7f214",
                                                "sense_id": "6b7d1f0b-795b-3fdf-b406-3179a7876991",
                                                "text": "Finally, although both the South and North Midlands are not known for their tropical climate, that's where mangoes grow. These aren't the tropical fruit, though, but what are elsewhere called green peppers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d6c4ab6-10e1-31b9-9e33-b93e52f45cdc",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of muskmelon, Cucumis melo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d392aaa-85d8-36ec-af43-94a39af81809",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various hummingbirds of the genus Anthracothorax."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fee4321-c64b-32b4-bc8c-7a71fcf1e3c0",
                                        "entry_id": "e4f74b62-639c-3614-b1cd-99bcdc1ff2a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A yellow-orange color, like that of mango flesh."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
